WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:03.921
(mysterious string music)

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.600
- [skekGra] Once we were one.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.483
A single single luminous form.

00:00:10.447 --> 00:00:12.720
One body, one will, one mind.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.000
We were perfect unity.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.960
We called ourselves

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:23.110
urSkeks.

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.010
- [urGoh] Two thousand trine ago,

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:30.070
eighteen of us left our world

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.437
and came to Thra.

00:00:32.437 --> 00:00:34.460
(fabric rustle)

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:35.512
(gasp)

00:00:35.512 --> 00:00:38.512
- [Brea] They're from another world.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.300
- We newly arrived urSkeks filled mother

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.430
Aughra's head with stories

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:46.600
of our adventures

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.593
amongst the stars.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.330
She longed to explore the

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.900
universe herself

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.973
so we gifted mother Aughra

00:00:53.973 --> 00:00:55.730
with her orrery

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:59.823
in exchange for the Crystal of Truth.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.580
But there can be no light

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.470
- [urGo] without dark.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.290
- [skekGra] We deceived
Aughra and harnessed

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:10.870
the power of the crystal for ourselves.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.644
Then in our arrogance,

00:01:13.644 --> 00:01:15.190
our experiments on

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.850
the crystal broke us into two.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:22.547
- [urGo] The Skeksis and Mystics.

00:01:22.547 --> 00:01:24.320
- [skekGra] In the shock of division

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.890
a skirmish arose.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:28.690
And the rathful Skeksis broke a shard

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:31.860
from the crystal creating the darkening.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.870
(gasps)

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:34.870
- [Rian] Where's the shard?

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.410
- [skekGra] We were
left as two left as two

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:38.856
halves trapped within separate bodies.

00:01:38.856 --> 00:01:39.689
(hissing sound)

00:01:39.689 --> 00:01:43.093
All we want now is to
return to our true form.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.033
- [urGoh] Where two is one.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.780
The other Mystics went into hiding

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:58.130
and await the day when their destiny

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.140
will reveal itself

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.790
at last.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.250
- [skekGra] We tried to
convince our fellow Skeksis

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.530
that we must be made whole.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:08.770
That is when they turned on us.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:10.930
Branded me heretic.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.633
And forced us into hiding.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.650
- [urGoh] We want to be rejoined

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.773
now.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.660
Every moment one are two

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.710
is too terrible

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.180
for one to bear.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.740
- [skekGra] But there is hope!

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.440
For we have glimpsed into the future

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.850
and seen our fate lies in the hands of

00:02:35.779 --> 00:02:37.350
the Gelfling.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:40.877
- [urGoh] For the Gelfling
are closest to Thra

00:02:42.294 --> 00:02:43.127
(distant roar)

00:02:43.127 --> 00:02:45.036
- [skekGra] Skeksis will stop at nothing

00:02:45.036 --> 00:02:47.805
to preserve their dominion over Thra.

00:02:47.805 --> 00:02:49.230
And so,

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.790
we forged our knowledge into a blade.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.957
- [urGoh] The Dual Glaive.

00:02:55.607 --> 00:02:59.357
(inspiring orchestral music)

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:02.650
- [skekGra] Cast in the deepest fires

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.380
of inner sun,

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.770
it carries the spirit of Thra

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.183
and, when wielded by Gelfling,

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.120
holds the power to unite the seven clans

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.435
and defeat

00:03:14.435 --> 00:03:15.435
the Skeksis.

00:03:19.345 --> 00:03:22.012
(crumble sound)

00:03:26.797 --> 00:03:28.500
(crackling sound)

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.870
- This is the sigil of great power

00:03:32.132 --> 00:03:33.619
the Olreal.

00:03:33.619 --> 00:03:35.336
- [Rian] I know that symbol.

00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:37.283
- [Brea] I saw it in a vision.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.140
- Seven clans,

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.313
- [urGoh] Seven fires,

00:03:43.313 --> 00:03:45.170
- [skekGra] Joined as one

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.110
in the cause of unity

00:03:48.301 --> 00:03:50.470
(hopeful music intensifies)

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:53.303
(crackling sound)

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:57.923
- [urGoh] What?

00:03:58.856 --> 00:04:00.403
I'm on fire!

00:04:00.403 --> 00:04:01.998
Put it out!

00:04:01.998 --> 00:04:02.831
Put it out!

00:04:02.831 --> 00:04:03.737
Put it out!

00:04:03.737 --> 00:04:06.654
- [skekGra] Put it out! Put it out!

